"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="21" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>시스템 설명</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="6" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6400" Protect="false" RowAddr="12" RowSpan="1" Width="39100"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>PC 사양·상태를 수집해 유지·설정 수정·부품 구매를 제안하고, 진단 근거와 필요한 상품의 검색 경로를 제공한다. Windows 수집 클라이언트·서버·저장소·웹으로 구성한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6900" Protect="false" RowAddr="13" RowSpan="1" Width="8900"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="21" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>시스템운영 환경</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="6" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6900" Protect="false" RowAddr="13" RowSpan="1" Width="39100"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>Windows/Python Agent, FastAPI, SQLite·PostgreSQL, React/TypeScript 및 정적 웹. React 실행에는 Node.js가 필요하다. 로컬 수집과 공개 모니터링의 전송 범위·인증을 구분한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="10500" Protect="false" RowAddr="14" RowSpan="1" Width="8900"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="21" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>개발 적용기술</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="6" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="10500" Protect="false" RowAddr="14" RowSpan="1" Width="39100"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>CIM/WMI·선택적 Sysmon, JSON Schema/Pydantic, 19개 진단 규칙, 상관·이상 신호·추세 분석, 선택적 Ollama, eBay 상품 경로, pytest/Playwright.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>목표 결과물: Agent·연결 GUI, 규칙 진단, 키 인증 모니터링, 진단 연계 구매·견적 웹, 실행·빌드 스크립트.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="17" Style="0" PageBreak="true" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="15"><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="17" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><TABLE BorderFill="4" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="2" PageBreak="None" RepeatHeader="false" RowCount="4"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1497088818" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="1"><SIZE Height="61900" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="47898" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Column" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="30000" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="9516"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="21" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>개발목표결과물(시스템 구성도,실행 화면)</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="30000" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="38382"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="20" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><PICTURE Reverse="false"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400003" Lock="false" NumberingType="Figure" ZOrder="4"><SIZE Height="10000" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="21053" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>system.png</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SHAPECOMPONENT CurHeight="10000" CurWidth="21053" GroupLevel="0" HorzFlip="false" InstID="1400003" OriHeight="71250" OriWidth="150000" VertFlip="false" XPos="0" YPos="0"><ROTATIONINFO Angle="0" CenterX="10526" CenterY="5000" Rotate="1"/><RENDERINGINFO><TRANSMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><SCAMATRIX E1="0.14035333333333333" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="0.14035087719298245" E6="0.00000"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><SCAMATRIX E1="0.17544" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="0.17544" E6="0.00000"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/></RENDERINGINFO></SHAPECOMPONENT><IMAGERECT X0="0" X1="150000" X2="150000" X3="0" Y0="0" Y1="0" Y2="71250" Y3="71250"/><IMAGECLIP Bottom="71280" Left="0" Right="150000" Top="0"/><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><IMAGEDIM Height="71280" Width="150000"/><IMAGE Alpha="0" BinItem="1" Bright="0" Contrast="0" Effect="RealPic"/><EFFECTS/></PICTURE></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>그림 1. 시스템 구성(상세 구성은 부록 그림 3 참조).</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="20" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><PICTURE Reverse="false"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400004" Lock="false" NumberingType="Figure" ZOrder="4"><SIZE Height="10000" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="16363" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>screens.png</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SHAPECOMPONENT CurHeight="10000" CurWidth="16363" GroupLevel="0" HorzFlip="false" InstID="1400004" OriHeight="82500" OriWidth="135000" VertFlip="false" XPos="0" YPos="0"><ROTATIONINFO Angle="0" CenterX="8181" CenterY="5000" Rotate="1"/><RENDERINGINFO><TRANSMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><SCAMATRIX E1="0.1212074074074074" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="0.12121212121212122" E6="0.00000"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><SCAMATRIX E1="0.14545" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="0.14545" E6="0.00000"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/></RENDERINGINFO></SHAPECOMPONENT><IMAGERECT X0="0" X1="135000" X2="135000" X3="0" Y0="0" Y1="0" Y2="82500" Y3="82500"/><IMAGECLIP Bottom="82500" Left="0" Right="135000" Top="0"/><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><IMAGEDIM Height="82500" Width="135000"/><IMAGE Alpha="0" BinItem="2" Bright="0" Contrast="0" Effect="RealPic"/><EFFECTS/></PICTURE></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>그림 2. 11월 5일 시험 화면. CPU 48%·가용 8GB·99,000원은 합성·모의 값이다. HTML 형태 문자는 보안 시험 입력이다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="15100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="9516"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="21" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>프로젝트 산출물목록</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="15100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="38382"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>Agent·API·웹 소스, 공통 계약, CPU/GPU 데이터셋, 운영·배포 문서, 실행·빌드 스크립트, 시험 코드·로그·화면, D07 시험결과서 및 본 D08.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>자동화 503건: Agent125·Backend295·PostgreSQL15·UI로직53·Edge15. 서로 다른 시험 계층의 참고 합계다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>D07 등록36건: P32·B4·F0·NT0, 수행 완료88.9%(시스템 시나리오10/14). 백로그 확인12·부분14·미충족4. 최종 합격 보류.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="14300" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="9516"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="21" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>시스템활용 효과</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="14300" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="38382"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>설정 조치와 교체 필요성을 근거로 구분한다. 비용 절감률·진단 정확도·만족도는 실증하지 않았다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>실기기 수집·진단, 견적 API 연결·결측 보존, Canvas 순서 제약과 격리 PostgreSQL 합성10기기·10분 전송·재시작·삭제를 확인했다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>Sysmon 실제 로그·외부 운영 재시작·eBay 성공 응답·Ollama 생성은 환경 차단. 통합 What-if·사후 개선 비교, 장기 부하·새 PC 설치 검증이 남아 있다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="2" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="2500" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="47898"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="200" Left="280" Right="280" Top="200"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>Key Words (5개): PC 진단, 텔레메트리, 규칙 기반 분석, 모니터링, 구매 의사결정</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="21"><CHAR>작성자 성명: 우태현                         확인자 성명: 우태현</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="18" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>2026.11.09 기준. 11.17 종료 실적은 선기재하지 않는다. 상세 근거·한계는 부록과 D07을 따른다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="15" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="7"><CHAR>부록: 최종 개발된 소프트웨어 세부 내용</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="15" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>아래의 ‘최종’은 2026년 11월 9일 개정 시점의 산출물을 의미하며 개발 종료·최종 인수를 뜻</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>하지 않는다. 실제 호출 경로와 구현 코드, D07 실행 증빙을 기준으로 기술했다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>1. 최종 시스템 아키텍처 (System Architecture)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="15" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><CHAR>1.1 최종 시스템 아키텍처 개요</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="15" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>시스템은 Windows 수집 클라이언트, API 서버, 저장소, 웹 클라이언트 및 선택적 외부 서비스</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>로 구성된다. 그림 3은 실제 구현된 실행 단위와 배포 경계를 나타낸다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><PICTURE Reverse="false"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400006" Lock="false" NumberingType="Figure" ZOrder="4"><SIZE Height="22890" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="48190" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>system.png</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SHAPECOMPONENT CurHeight="22890" CurWidth="48190" GroupLevel="0" HorzFlip="false" InstID="1400006" OriHeight="71250" OriWidth="150000" VertFlip="false" XPos="0" YPos="0"><ROTATIONINFO Angle="0" CenterX="24095" CenterY="11445" Rotate="1"/><RENDERINGINFO><TRANSMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><SCAMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><SCAMATRIX E1="0.32127" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="0.32126" E6="0.00000"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/></RENDERINGINFO></SHAPECOMPONENT><IMAGERECT X0="0" X1="150000" X2="150000" X3="0" Y0="0" Y1="0" Y2="71250" Y3="71250"/><IMAGECLIP Bottom="71280" Left="0" Right="150000" Top="0"/><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><IMAGEDIM Height="71280" Width="150000"/><IMAGE Alpha="0" BinItem="3" Bright="0" Contrast="0" Effect="RealPic"/><EFFECTS/></PICTURE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>그림 3. 시스템 배치 및 데이터 흐름. 서버의 공개/로컬 모드는 설정으로 구분한다. 공개 배포</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR> 설정에서는 인증 없는 /api/scan/*, /api/diagnosis/*를 등록하지 않는다. 정적 모니터링·견</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>적 화면은 FastAPI에서 같은 출처로 제공한다. React 진단 UI는 로컬 실행기가 별도 포트로 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>제공하며 API 주소·CORS를 맞춘다. Agent는 사용자 PC에서 별도로 실행한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>• 로컬 Basic Scan: 하드웨어, 성능, 저장장치 건강도, 신뢰성 이벤트를 수집한다. 기본 저장 위</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>치는 사용자 로컬 SQLite다. 사용자가 업로드 옵션을 선택하면 개발용 API로 전송한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>• 공개 모니터링: 웹 연결 → 일회용 연결 코드 교환 또는 설정 다운로드 → Agent 실행 → 인</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>증 업로드 → 이력 조회 순서다. Windows GUI는 연결 정보를 DPAPI로 저장한다. watch의 전</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>송 섹션은 hardware/performance/security로 제한된다. 모니터링 저장 시 규칙 진단도 실행</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="15" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><CHAR>1. 최종 시스템 아키텍처 (System Architecture) (계속)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>• 저장소: 로컬 Agent는 snapshots, collector_runs 등을 관리한다. 로컬 Backend는 스냅샷·프</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>로세스 이벤트·진단 이력을 저장한다. 공개 경로는 monitor_devices, monitor_samples, monit</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>or_events를 사용한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>• 보관·권한: 공개 경로의 자료 조회 범위는 7일, 연결키 유효기간은 90일이다. 만료 데이터 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>정리는 업로드·연결 생성 등 코드에 지정된 작업 시 수행되며 별도 상시 정리 스케줄러로 보</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>장하지 않는다. 연결 해제는 해당 기기의 이력과 키를 삭제한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>• 외부 의존성: 현재 상품·판매가 조회 경로는 eBay Browse API다. 이전 네이버 API 호출은 중</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>단 상태로 처리하고 쇼핑 검색 링크는 별도로 제공한다. 가격과 상품 정보는 제공자 인증·응</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>답에 의존한다. Ollama는 선택적 설명 서비스다. 규칙 판정 자체는 LLM 없이 실행된다. 공개 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>모니터링 저장 경로는 diagnose()를 직접 호출하며 자동으로 Gemma 설명을 생성하지 않는</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>2. 소프트웨어 아키텍처 (Software Architecture)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="15" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><CHAR>2.1 아키텍처 구조</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="15" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>그림 4의 패키지 관계는 수집, 계약 검증, 판정, 저장 및 표현의 책임을 구분한다. Python은 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>클래스와 함수 모듈을 함께 사용하고, 정적 프론트엔드는 JavaScript 함수 단위, React 진단 U</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>I는 TypeScript 컴포넌트 단위로 구성된다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><PICTURE Reverse="false"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400007" Lock="false" NumberingType="Figure" ZOrder="4"><SIZE Height="22890" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="48190" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>packages.png</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SHAPECOMPONENT CurHeight="22890" CurWidth="48190" GroupLevel="0" HorzFlip="false" InstID="1400007" OriHeight="71250" OriWidth="150000" VertFlip="false" XPos="0" YPos="0"><ROTATIONINFO Angle="0" CenterX="24095" CenterY="11445" Rotate="1"/><RENDERINGINFO><TRANSMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><SCAMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><SCAMATRIX E1="0.32127" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="0.32126" E6="0.00000"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/></RENDERINGINFO></SHAPECOMPONENT><IMAGERECT X0="0" X1="150000" X2="150000" X3="0" Y0="0" Y1="0" Y2="71250" Y3="71250"/><IMAGECLIP Bottom="71280" Left="0" Right="150000" Top="0"/><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><IMAGEDIM Height="71280" Width="150000"/><IMAGE Alpha="0" BinItem="4" Bright="0" Contrast="0" Effect="RealPic"/><EFFECTS/></PICTURE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="15" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><CHAR>2. 소프트웨어 아키텍처 (Software Architecture) (계속)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>그림 4. 소프트웨어 패키지 구성. 견적 화면은 /api/evaluate-build 응답을 사용하고 미등록 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>모델·조회 실패는 수치 표시를 보류한다. React 진단 UI는 /api/scans/*를 통해 스캔 진행과 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>해당 스캔의 결과를 조회한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><CHAR>2.2 컴포넌드/패키지 설명</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="15" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="14"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>표 1. 컴포넌트·패키지별 책임</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="15" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="4" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="8"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400008" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="0"><SIZE Height="43800" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="42520" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Column" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="9354"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>번호</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="11905"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>컴포넌트/패키지 이름</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="13606"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>설명</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="7655"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>비고</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="8100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="9354"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>1</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="8100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="11905"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>agent/speccheck_agent</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="8100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="13606"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>CLI·Windows GUI, 반복 수</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>집, 설정 로드, 수집기 실행, </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>로컬 분석·저장 및 선택 전</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>송을 조정한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="8100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="7655"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>별도 실행 프로</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>세스; 런타임 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>외부 Python </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>패키지 의존성 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>없음</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="9354"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>2</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="11905"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>collectors, win</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="13606"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>CIM/WMI, 성능 표본, 저장</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>장치 상태, 이벤트 로그를 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>조회하고 오류를 섹션 단위</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>로 격리한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="7655"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>Sysmon은 추</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>가 동의 필요</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="9354"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>3</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="11905"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>snapshot, pipeline</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="13606"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>수집 결과를 버전 있는 스냅</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>샷으로 구성하고, 사양·건강 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>프로필 및 SQLite 이력으로 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>변환한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="7655"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>현재 스냅샷 계</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>약 1.2.0</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="5100" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="9354"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" Ver